{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nota": {
    "es": "Del estado que calcula el ciclo a las banderas de DefectDojo. Solo «cerrado» sale mitigado, y solo con una re-prueba confirmada; un reabierto sale activo; eliminar o «no se reproduce» cierra sin mitigar.",
    "en": "From the state the cycle computes to DefectDojo's flags. Only “cerrado” is exported as mitigated, and only with a confirmed re-test; a reopened finding is exported active; removal or “not reproducible” closes without mitigating."
  },
  "fuente": "https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/3.5.100/dojo/tools/generic/json_parser.py",
